  "details": "Forgive my brevity as I am on my phone, but the lack of the ability to quickly and effectively organise groups prevents me from taking full advantage of the group features that already exist. Friends and Worlds are the main elements I am speaking of -- I want to curate playlists of worlds, but am frustrated by the unintuitive UI and excessive amount of actions required to categorize even a single world. Same for friends -- I very much want to separate my friends list into the different social groups I am a part of, but it has proven to be more trouble than it is worth. The problems are compounded by the often slow-to-update playlists and groups themselves, but I believe the UI is a major part of what causes me to not use an existing feature that does exactly what I want.\n\nThank you!",
